{"crw-nogi-21744":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントいつもたくさん\nありがとう(∩^ω^∩)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一つ一つしっかり\n読ませてもらってます(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"できることなら全部に\n返事したいくらい♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"突然ですが\n真夏vsバランスボール"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人がやってるのを見て\n何であんな簡単そうなのに\nみんな出来ないんだろ？\nってずっと思ってて自分は\n挑戦したことなかったので\nいざ挑戦！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/11/23/4243569/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んっ⁈(揺れる...！)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバー:真夏がやったら頭打つよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大丈夫大丈夫♪"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/11/23/4243569/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふぉっ(いい感じ？)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/11/23/4243569/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"くいっ(どこに力入れればいいの？!)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/11/23/4243569/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んー誰か助けてー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マネージャーM:足ついてんじゃん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/11/23/4243569/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きたーー！ここだ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よっこらせっ♪"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/11/23/4243569/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ！余裕出てきた♪楽勝〜♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んんっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/11/23/4243569/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と思ったら腹筋痛い。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"勝敗は..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バランスボールの勝利"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"百聞は一見に如かず。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"完。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみにバドミントンも\n私からするとかなりの敵(-ω-；)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やるのはすごく好きなんだけど\nサーブが入ったことない(´･ω･ゞ)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全部かすって自分の手打ちます..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから高校時代の体育の\nバドミントンは散々な\n成績でした(´=ω=｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"体育大好きなのに\n体育に好かれてないよー(；ω；)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/11/23/4243569/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は幕張で握手会♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寒くなってきたこういう時期の\n握手会はより一層握手日和な\n気がしてます(((っ･ω･)っ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぎゅーってすれば\nあったかくなる♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何着ようかな？♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくれる方は風邪引かないように\nたくさん着込んで来てねっ(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NOGIBINGOではOLさんに\nなったんだけどあまりにキザな\nちーちゃんにやられてしまった///"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/11/23/4243569/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中学生の頃、学校の行事で\n宝塚観に行ったことが\nあるんだけどまた行きたいなぁ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"逆ハーレム..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/11/23/4243569/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よりも後ろのオスカル。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は写ってないけど"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/11/23/4243569/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"後ろのオスカルwithななみ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみの輩、好き（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せんぱーい♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/11/23/4243569/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お仕事教えてください♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ダメ...ですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近ね、ハリネズミを\n飼いたくて飼いたくて\nどうしようかと思ってて\nいろいろ調べてみたら\nなんとなんと大好物が\nコオロギらしい(OωO )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それを見て、\nコオロギはあげられないなぁ...\nって話をしてたらなぁちゃんに\nでも真夏なら「あ♪そろそろ\nコオロギあげなきゃ〜♡」とか\n言ってあげてそうじゃない？\nって言われた（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃあせっかくだから\n挑戦してみよ......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いや、しない(´=ω=｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/11/23/4243569/0012.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃ、またね(∩^ω^∩)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ♪\n現在発売中の\n月刊モーニング・ツーに\n出させていただいてるので\nぜひぜひチェックお願いします！"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-24159":{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/06/18/2491766/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(●･ω･)ﾉ------------start------------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/06/18/2491766/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これは前の収録の時に撮った画像なんだけど\n月曜のRの法則生放送見てくれたかな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/06/18/2491766/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回は出川さんと足立梨花さんがゲストで来て下さいました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/06/18/2491766/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/06/18/2491766/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/06/18/2491766/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回はイライラ解消術をテーマに色々なことをしました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/06/18/2491766/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みーちゃんとまあやでTwitterでの皆さんからのメッセージを受け取る呼びかけ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みたいなのを番組でしたんだけどめっちゃかんじゃった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/06/18/2491766/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/06/18/2491766/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも日常でできそうなイライラ解消術とかあったからやってみようと思う～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/06/18/2491766/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マスクにアロマ垂らしたりとか～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/06/18/2491766/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"٩(  ´͈ ᵕ `͈ ๑)༊༅✧ˈ‧˚⁺(๑॔ᵒ̴̶̷◡˂̶๑॓)ゞ❣"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっちなみに今日のRの法則も見てくれたかなぁ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/06/18/2491766/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NOGIBINGOも見てくださいましたか～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/06/18/2491766/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"１日に２回テレビでまあやを見れたんじゃないかちらっ？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/06/18/2491766/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/06/18/2491766/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Yahoo!ニュースとかライブドアニュースとかになってるよ～って７５５でみなさんが教えてくれてびっくりした～(⑅ ॣ•͈૦•͈ ॣ)꒳ᵒ꒳ᵎᵎᵎ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやのお父さんへの愛がバレてしまったかな？(๑́•∀•๑̀)ฅﾃﾍ-"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに今お父さん東京来てたから昨日晩御飯一緒に食べたよ～んっ♡"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/06/18/2491766/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/06/18/2491766/0013.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(まだ衣装解禁されてないから隠した～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/06/18/2491766/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/06/18/2491766/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":")"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/06/18/2491766/0016.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"のぎ天ゴルフ部見てくれましたかぁ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/06/18/2491766/0017.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"強化合宿で少しは成長できたんじゃないかと我々部員は思っとります～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/06/18/2491766/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めっちゃハードなスケジュールだったけど結果オーライでいい合宿だったなぁ～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/06/18/2491766/0019.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに１日目の最後に回ったホールでは\n部員の中で１位でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/06/18/2491766/0019.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/06/18/2491766/0019.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/06/18/2491766/0019.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからももっと上手くなるように頑張りますっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/06/18/2491766/0020.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして台湾クイズも頑張りましたよ～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/06/18/2491766/0021.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木團かっこよかったぁ～ヾ(●´∇｀●)ﾉ\nみんな輝いてる～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/06/18/2491766/0022.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてお土産もわざわざかってくれてありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/06/18/2491766/0023.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今洗濯してるよ～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/06/18/2491766/0024.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"レッスンとかパジャマに使わせていただきます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/06/18/2491766/0025.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも問題難しすぎるなぁ～(*´•×•`*)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/06/18/2491766/0026.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも沢山良かったよって言ってもらえたからこれも結果オーライかな？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/06/18/2491766/0027.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/06/18/2491766/0027.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/06/18/2491766/0027.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/06/18/2491766/0028.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"季節外れのサンタさん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/06/18/2491766/0029.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして松井玲奈さんの卒業発表！\n正直びっくりしました！\n玲奈さんは何に対しても全部に全力投球で忙しいのに乃木坂に兼任できてくださってライブにも出てくださって..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"名前もすぐ覚えてくれたのはほんとに嬉しかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/06/18/2491766/0030.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブしてる時のレナさん！ほんとに素敵なアイドルでキャピキャピしてて！はじけた笑顔大好き"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/06/18/2491766/0031.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ホントに感謝することばかりです！\n寂しいけど、卒業の時はおめでとう！って笑顔で言いたいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/06/18/2491766/0032.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂にも遊びに来て欲しいなっ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(○･ω･)ﾉ-------------end-------------BYE"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-33768":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは！\n山崎怜奈です(  ´ω`  )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっと、大学が夏休み中です～\n暑さに弱いので、\n休日は家でのんびりしていることが多いです＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さて、最近\n中国語の勉強を始めました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前から興味があったので、\n暇なときに少しずつ覚えています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また、乃木坂の握手会によく来てくださる\n中国語話者のファンの方々は、\nいつも日本語を少しずつ覚えてから\n会いに来てくださるんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当は沢山話したいことがあるはずなのに、\n言語の隔たりがあるから\nいつも同じようなことしか\n話してあげられないのが心残りで(´･_･`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その気持ちに応えたいなぁ、\nもっと色々なお話をできたら\nお互い楽しいだろうなぁと思い、\n勉強し始めました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とはいえ、そんなに簡単に\n習得できるわけが無く(T . T)、\nまだ発音や聞き取りができないから\n会話をするレベルには至らないのですが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まずは文法や基本的な会話を\n身につけようと思い、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"755に中国語でコメントをしてくださる\n香港や台湾、中国のファンの方に\n毎日ちょっとずつ返しています♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、時間があるときはなるべく\n中国語でもブログを書こうと思いまして、\nさっそく一番最後に少しだけ書いてみました\n間違ってたらすみませんm(_ _)m"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではでは！\n今日は短めですがこれにて(*^_^*)\nまた更新しますね～～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日の名古屋ライブがんばります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"p.s.今日は写真集の発売日ですよー！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"れな"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rena.yamazaki/img/files/46/_pre/blog/rena.yamazaki/img/2016/08/06/0932616/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"晩上好！\n我叫山崎怜奈(  ´ω`  )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"终于、我的大学现在是夏假～\n因为我怕热、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"我休息日大多在家好好休息＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"那么、最近\n开始学习中文了！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"因为从以前开始有兴趣、\n没事儿的时候我一点点学中文。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"而且、总是\n从中国和台湾\"乃木坂46握手会\"的爱好者\n稍微记日语之后来。\n谢谢你努力想要传达！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"我的汉语还不太好。。\n为了能和你们用中国话交谈、我也要努力。\n我想早点变得会说中文。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"谢谢你阅读我的博客ヽ( ･ω･ )ノ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"p.s.今天是写真集的销售日ー！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"怜奈"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rena.yamazaki/img/files/46/_pre/blog/rena.yamazaki/img/2016/08/06/0932616/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rena.yamazaki/img/files/46/_pre/blog/rena.yamazaki/img/2016/08/06/0932616/0002.jpeg","alt":""}],"source":"archive"},"sba-hinata-22311":{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" \n \n \n \n みなさん、こんにちは꒰⑅ᵕ༚ᵕ꒱˖♡\n \n 佐々木美玲です！！\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1151C225FGVTT7J0FQC0RS","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n 日曜日の欅って書けないで\n \n リアクションチェックの回が\n \n 放送されました！！\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n 見てくださりましたか〜？？\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n 富士急ハイランドに行くのは\n \n 人生の中で２回目でした！！！\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n まずは、高飛車から。\n \n 家族で1度行ったことがあって\n \n その時に高飛車に乗ったんですが、\n \n 全然怖いなかったって当時は\n \n 思っていたので、余裕で\n \n 乗ったんですけど想像してた以上に\n \n 怖くてびっくりしました(´｡✪ω✪｡｀)✧\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1152CGM3WZZ4XD3ZH47JKY","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n ヘルメットをつけてたせいか、\n \n 首をもっていかれて、大変でした。\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n 一緒に乗ったまなふぃーは\n \n ずっと怖いがって泣いてたけど、、。\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n 放送見て、まなふぃーの怖がり方が\n \n 可愛すぎて写真撮りました！(^-^)\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n 次は、お化け屋敷。\n \n \n \n \n \n お化け屋敷は大の苦手だったので\n \n 本当に怖かったです。\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n 一緒に回るなっちょもゆうかも\n \n お化けが苦手って言ってたので\n \n 本当に不安でした。\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n 放送見ていたら私あんなに\n \n 高音なんだ！って思いました！笑\n \n \n \n うるさくてすみません( ´•̥̥̥ω•̥̥̥`)\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n 戦闘態勢で向ったんですけど\n \n やっぱり無理でした、、、。\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n 結論、お化け屋敷はやっぱり苦手です！笑\n \n \n \n \n \n \n 私、めみのリアクションが\n \n すごく面白かったです！！\n \n \n あとまおのピースが大好きでした！\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n 見てくださったみなさん\n \n ありがとうございました！！！\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n 次はもっとオーバーに\n \n リアクションできるように頑張ります！\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n それじゃあバイバーイ꒰●꒡ ̫ ꒡●꒱\n \n \n \n \n \n ＊佐々木美玲＊"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-5948":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近\nロマンス・プライバシーのフリコピしてる中田です(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"曲もダンスも衣装もああいうのが好き(*´｀*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さあさあ、こんばんわさび！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わさびかけてる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田はレッスンオワタ＼^^／←違"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"で、前の学校で一緒だった友達に電車で会って\n一緒に帰ってるよ(*・ω・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"去年みたま一緒に行ったな〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久々に会ったけど\n相変わらず\nメールを打つのが光の速さでした(・∀・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"the　Ｊ Ｋ　　　　きらきらきら*。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いやー\nしかし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年でJKも終わりか〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寂しいなあ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういえば"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"DDって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「男子大学生」の略でもあるんだね(゜ロ゜)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「「答えちゃうお( °_ゝ°)ノ」」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木どこの時の服個別で着てたよね？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\n着てないよ、ってか持ってないよ＞＜\nどの服のことだろ(´・ω・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どんな野菜ジュースが好き？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\nこれいちが好き！\n前にも書いたけど\n乃木坂入る前の話だけど\nAKB48さんの待ち受け集めるために\nよく飲んでたらはまった(*^^*)\n今はほぼ毎日飲んでるよ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"韓国料理で何が好き？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\nトッポギとビビンバが好き＼^^／\n行ったときは食べなかったけど＞＜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"韓国語話す機会あった？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\n無かった(￣∇￣)\nけっこう日本語通じるんだよね！\nアニョハセヨとかカムサハムニダとかは\n使いたくて使ったけど(・∀・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"辛いもの食べれる？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\n並みくらいなら食べれるよ(*・ω・)ノ\nでも、\nななみんとかみたいなんじゃないから\n辛すぎるのは無理＞＜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夏だし\n浴衣の写メこれから\nどんどん載せよ(*・ω・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/17/3404123/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前髪のび太くん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-30164":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"おはよう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2016/01/17/9198057/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2016/01/17/9198057/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会で思いましたが\nBUBKAのグラビアが好評でしたな！\n絶妙にもさくて私もお気に入りです。\n撮影はいろんなテーマでやるけど、\n生々しい日常感の雰囲気も良い！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2016/01/17/9198057/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"我のカガリシリーズが増えました。\nやはり最高です∠( 'ω')／\nかっこよすぎて毎日眺めてます。\n絶妙な錆びなんだなあ、金具も電線までも。\n流石すなあ！！！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"綺麗なお花とか見てると\n何かつまんね、と感じます。\n良い意味で綺麗と\n対照的なものを組み合わせると\n好みになります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近は、いろいろ実行中です。\n好きなものに囲まれて考えて考えて\n生活することがいちばんの癒しヽ(ﾟ､｡)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"EX大衆発売中\nみなみと対談で熱い私と\n95年組対談に注目！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2016/01/17/9198057/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お知らせ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「さぬき映画祭」にて上映される\n映画「アニバーサリー」に出演します。\nメディコム・トイ20周年記念に\nつくられた映画になります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5つのオムニバスストーリーの中の\n「記念日が行方不明」\n11thペアPV以来の高橋栄樹さん！\n脚本は狗飼恭子さん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このストーリーの主人公になれたこと、\nまた映像に関われたことが嬉しい。\nとても素敵な作品！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2月21日（日）16:00\nアルファあなぶきホール・小ホールで上映"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"香川県民の皆様\nよろしくお願いします。\n香川県にお住まいじゃない方も\n観に来てくれたら尚喜びます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2016/01/17/9198057/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういえば、11thの生駒と私のペアPV\nどこにも公開されることがないであろう\n長編があること知ってましたか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}}